  "releaseNotes": "OGEditorSDK v1.0.1\n\nOGEditorSDK — generic OASIS Omniverse editor plugin module. Plug into any map editor (UDB, TrenchBroom, NetRadiant, DarkRadiant, Mapster32, or any web editor via REST). Provides the OGAsset catalog, map sidecar, STAR API client, entity conversion tables, and cross-game portal/quest binding shared by all OGEngine editors. Mirror of STARAPIClient — but for creators/editors rather than for playing games.\n\nWhat's new since v1.0.0\n- Initial validated package contents and metadata for this release line.\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/OASIS Omniverse/OGEditorSDK",
